Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 13:51:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 41/45] decide: llama-decide --mmproj and image-token limits;
 dump of image states for string replays

stb_image failure reasons are made printable ASCII before they enter a 400 message (an unknown PNG chunk type carries raw file bytes); the CLI catches any std::exception. Tests: an unknown critical chunk with non-ASCII type bytes, a real 1x1 BMP rejected by pass 1 and by the pixel decoder.
